105825/files#diff-50009c888f4511cee5a3bdb4bf7d8b2407ab39e27ac1c7601f4af44671546ae8R221).\n\n@kleiders3010 does it also reproduce when position smoothing is disabled but limit smoothing is enabled?\n\nThe code changes in the PR I submitted should only take effect if the limit bounds are strictly smaller than the screen size (not equal as you described in your test case). I just did a quick double check and I can't see any difference to the other branches in this scenario. That said, I don't quite understand the logic of \n```c++\nPoint2 bottom_right_corner = Point2(screen_rect.position + 2.0 * (camera_pos - screen_rect.position));\n``` \nfrom the other PR which I [mentioned earlier](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105825#issuecomment-2892458196). @Alex-Onceanu, any chance this bug rings some bells?\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3010884373/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3010888058","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107988#issuecomment-3010888058","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107988","id":3010888058,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zdoF6","user":{"login":"kleiders3010","id":71478358,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDc4MzU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71478358?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleiders3010","html_url":"https://github.com/kleiders3010","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleiders3010/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleiders3010/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleiders3010/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleiders3010/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"htt